@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Support";
}
<section class="container legal-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">Help and support</span>
    <h1>Need help with this instance?</h1>
    <p class="lead">Support is managed by the organization operating the specific CareAxis deployment.</p>
    <div class="panel-card">
        <h2>For account or workflow questions</h2>
        <p>Contact your deployment administrator using the support channel provided by that organization. This source repository does not include a staffed support desk, monitored inbox, or service-level commitment.</p>
        <p>If email verification or password recovery is unavailable, the operator may not have enabled SMTP delivery. Do not ask staff to send passwords or verification tokens over an unapproved channel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-card mt-3">
        <h2>For urgent health concerns</h2>
        <p>This demonstration is not monitored for urgent requests and cannot provide medical advice. Contact a qualified care provider or local emergency services.</p>
    </div>
</section>
